  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-weight:400\"> ♪</span><span style=\"font-size:36px\">&nbsp;Alex的怪物 額外音樂 ♪</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">重要提示：這是另一個模組「Alex的怪物」的附加內容。&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此前往</a>該模組頁面（其非官方1.21.1移植版請<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs-1-21-1-port\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此</a>）。</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">目前，此模組僅新增了虛空蠕蟲戰鬥時的音樂。若擊敗牠，還會播放勝利主題曲。</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>您可透過遊戲選單中的「選項 &gt; 音樂與音效」，調整「唱片機/音階盒」滑桿來控制本模組音樂的音量。</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在Soundcloud聆聽虛空蠕蟲的戰鬥主題曲：&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fthe-exiied-feiiow%252fdominus-nihilus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://soundcloud.com/the-exiied-feiiow/dominus-nihilus</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在Newgrounds聆聽虛空蠕蟲的戰鬥主題曲：&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.newgrounds.com%252faudio%252flisten%252f1055200\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.newgrounds.com/audio/listen/1055200</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">在Youtube聆聽虛空蠕蟲的戰鬥主題曲：</span></p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9EQcFrYzX2U?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如何解決「Boss生成時音樂播放」問題</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">您可能安裝了<strong>動態環繞</strong>模組。別擔心，無需移除該模組。請依照以下步驟，即可<strong>在保留動態環繞模組的同時</strong>徹底解決問題。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1T0fpHUYm9zE_luBFx0mNjUFQxZxxc6drXSR_lBbBJCc/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1T0fpHUYm9zE_luBFx0mNjUFQxZxxc6drXSR_lBbBJCc/edit?usp=sharing</a></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
